\begin{remark}[Ricci flow on closed surfaces]
\label{rem:chow-ii-appd-closed-surfaces}
\source{chow-et-al-ricci-flow-part-ii:page-0385}
\dcref{appD:D.8}
\group{Ricci Flow Convergence}

On every closed surface, the normalized Ricci flow exists globally and
converges to a constant-curvature metric.
\end{remark}

